    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scattered-Spider-Hacker-Gets-Six-Years-for-11.6-Million-Crypto-Theft.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/scattered-spider-hacker-six-years-crypto-theft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Scattered Spider Hacker Gets Six Years for $11.6 Million Crypto Theft</a></p>\n<p>A Scottish hacker tied to Scattered Spider was sentenced to six years in U.S. prison for a SIM-swap and phishing scheme that stole at least $11.6 million in crypto.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/scattered-spider-hacker-six-years-crypto-theft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Scattered Spider Hacker Gets Six Years for $11.6 Million Crypto Theft</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
